OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCold and crisp start, with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine, and light winds.
OL,7,FWhile the odd patch of cloud could
OL,8,Fdevelop through the day, it will stay
OL,9,Fdry, sunny but also rather cold for
OL,10,Fmost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome thin cloud likely
OL,13,Fovernight, but also occasional clear
OL,14,Fspells. Staying cold with a widespread
OL,15,Ffrost and light winds. Perhaps the odd
OL,16,Fpatch of freezing fog developing in
OL,17,Fprone spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
