OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother largely fine day,
OL,6,Fwith some brighter or sunny spells,
OL,7,Fbut perhaps a little cloudier than
OL,8,FFriday. This will lead to a rather
OL,9,Fcold feel, especially in the
OL,10,Fdeveloping breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLess
OL,13,Fcold on Sunday and Monday, but also
OL,14,Fturning changeable with spells of rain
OL,15,Falong with drier and brighter
OL,16,Fintervals. Unsettled on Tuesday,
OL,17,Fperhaps with more persistent rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
